# Runtime dependencies of the modules the fuzz harnesses import, at the versions in uv.lock.
# The ClusterFuzzLite image runs Python 3.11, so requirements.txt is resolved for 3.11. After a lock change:
#   uv pip compile --python-version 3.11 --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_28 --generate-hashes \
#     fuzz/requirements.in -o fuzz/requirements.txt
